{"seq":4,"slug":"tree-sitter-wasm","title":"Tree-sitter WASM 浏览器端解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/tree-sitter-ecosystem/tree-sitter-wasm","wordCount":1023,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"tree-sitter-wasm-浏览器端解析\">Tree-sitter WASM 浏览器端解析</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>web-tree-sitter 把 Tree-sitter 的 C 核心编译成 WebAssembly，让浏览器也能运行同一套解析器。它要解决的核心矛盾是：<strong>浏览器不能直接跑原生代码，但 Web IDE 又需要和桌面端一致的语法分析能力</strong>。围绕这一点，落地时的关注点集中在几处：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>异步初始化</td>\n<td><code>Parser.init()</code> 与 <code>Language.load()</code> 都是异步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态加载语法</td>\n<td>按需拉取 <code>.wasm</code> 语法文件并缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能代价</td>\n<td>约为原生实现的 60-80%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主线程保护</td>\n<td>解析应放入 Web Worker，避免阻塞渲染</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>理解 web-tree-sitter 的关键是把「加载」和「解析」两件事分开看——语法文件是运行时可插拔的资源，而不是打包进程序的固定代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"web-tree-sitter-概述\">web-tree-sitter 概述</h2><p>web-tree-sitter 是 Tree-sitter 的 WebAssembly 编译版本，允许在浏览器和 Node.js 中使用 Tree-sitter 的全部解析能力。它为 Web IDE、在线代码编辑器和代码分析工具提供了基础。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import Parser from &#39;web-tree-sitter&#39;;&#10;&#10;async function initParser(): Promise&lt;Parser&gt; {&#10;  await Parser.init();&#10;  const parser = new Parser();&#10;&#10;  const Lang = await Parser.Language.load(&#39;/tree-sitter-typescript.wasm&#39;);&#10;  parser.setLanguage(Lang);&#10;&#10;  return parser;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function parseCode(parser: Parser, code: string): Promise&lt;Parser.Tree&gt; {&#10;  return parser.parse(code);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Parser </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'web-tree-sitter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> initParser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Parser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Parser.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> parser</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Parser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Lang</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Parser.Language.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">load</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/tree-sitter-typescript.wasm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  parser.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setLanguage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Lang);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parser;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseCode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">parser</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Parser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Parser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Tree</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parser.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(code);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;浏览器环境&quot;&#10;        APP[Web 应用] --&gt; WASM_PARSER[web-tree-sitter.wasm]&#10;        WASM_PARSER --&gt; LANG_WASM[tree-sitter-typescript.wasm]&#10;        APP --&gt; EDITOR_UI[Monaco / CodeMirror]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;构建时&quot;&#10;        GRAMMAR[&quot;grammar.js&quot;] --&gt; BUILD[&quot;tree-sitter build-wasm&quot;]&#10;        BUILD --&gt; WASM_FILE[&quot;.wasm 语法文件&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    WASM_FILE --&gt;|动态加载| LANG_WASM\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"浏览器环境\"\n        APP[Web 应用] --&gt; WASM_PARSER[web-tree-sitter.wasm]\n        WASM_PARSER --&gt; LANG_WASM[tree-sitter-typescript.wasm]\n        APP --&gt; EDITOR_UI[Monaco / CodeMirror]\n    end\n    subgraph \"构建时\"\n        GRAMMAR[\"grammar.js\"] --&gt; BUILD[\"tree-sitter build-wasm\"]\n        BUILD --&gt; WASM_FILE[\".wasm 语法文件\"]\n    end\n    WASM_FILE --&gt;|动态加载| LANG_WASM</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Node.js tree-sitter</th>\n<th>web-tree-sitter</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>运行环境</td>\n<td>Node.js（原生 C 绑定）</td>\n<td>浏览器 + Node.js (WASM)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n<td>约为原生的 60-80%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>初始化</td>\n<td>同步</td>\n<td>异步（需 await init）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语法加载</td>\n<td>require()</td>\n<td>Language.load() 异步加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包大小</td>\n<td>原生编译</td>\n<td>~200KB (core wasm)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多线程</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>通过 Web Worker 支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>Parser.init()</code> 只需调用一次，后续可以创建多个 Parser 实例。语法文件通过 <code>Language.load()</code> 异步加载，支持 URL 路径或 ArrayBuffer。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"动态加载-wasm-语法\">动态加载 .wasm 语法</h2><p>web-tree-sitter 支持按需动态加载语法文件，这对于支持多种编程语言的 Web IDE 至关重要。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class LanguageManager {&#10;  private languages: Map&lt;string, Parser.Language&gt; = new Map();&#10;  private loading: Map&lt;string, Promise&lt;Parser.Language&gt;&gt; = new Map();&#10;&#10;  async getLanguage(langId: string): Promise&lt;Parser.Language&gt; {&#10;    const cached = this.languages.get(langId);&#10;    if (cached) return cached;&#10;&#10;    let loadPromise = this.loading.get(langId);&#10;    if (!loadPromise) {&#10;      loadPromise = Parser.Language.load(`/grammars/tree-sitter-${langId}.wasm`);&#10;      this.loading.set(langId, loadPromise);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    const language = await loadPromise;&#10;    this.languages.set(langId, language);&#10;    this.loading.delete(langId);&#10;    return language;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LanguageManager</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> languages</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Parser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Language</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> loading</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Parser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Language</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getLanguage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">langId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Parser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Language</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cached</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.languages.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(langId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cached) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cached;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loadPromise </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.loading.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(langId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">loadPromise) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      loadPromise </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Parser.Language.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">load</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`/grammars/tree-sitter-${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">langId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}.wasm`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.loading.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(langId, loadPromise);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> language</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loadPromise;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.languages.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(langId, language);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.loading.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(langId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> language;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant UI as 编辑器 UI&#10;    participant LM as LanguageManager&#10;    participant NET as 网络&#10;    participant WASM as WASM 运行时&#10;&#10;    UI-&gt;&gt;LM: getLanguage(&quot;typescript&quot;)&#10;    LM-&gt;&gt;LM: 检查缓存(未命中)&#10;    LM-&gt;&gt;NET: fetch(&quot;/grammars/tree-sitter-typescript.wasm&quot;)&#10;    NET--&gt;&gt;LM: ArrayBuffer&#10;    LM-&gt;&gt;WASM: Language.load(buffer)&#10;    WASM--&gt;&gt;LM: Language 实例&#10;    LM-&gt;&gt;LM: 缓存 Language&#10;    LM--&gt;&gt;UI: Language 实例&#10;&#10;    UI-&gt;&gt;LM: getLanguage(&quot;typescript&quot;) (再次)&#10;    LM-&gt;&gt;LM: 检查缓存(命中)&#10;    LM--&gt;&gt;UI: 缓存的 Language 实例\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant UI as 编辑器 UI\n    participant LM as LanguageManager\n    participant NET as 网络\n    participant WASM as WASM 运行时\n\n    UI-&gt;&gt;LM: getLanguage(\"typescript\")\n    LM-&gt;&gt;LM: 检查缓存(未命中)\n    LM-&gt;&gt;NET: fetch(\"/grammars/tree-sitter-typescript.wasm\")\n    NET--&gt;&gt;LM: ArrayBuffer\n    LM-&gt;&gt;WASM: Language.load(buffer)\n    WASM--&gt;&gt;LM: Language 实例\n    LM-&gt;&gt;LM: 缓存 Language\n    LM--&gt;&gt;UI: Language 实例\n\n    UI-&gt;&gt;LM: getLanguage(\"typescript\") (再次)\n    LM-&gt;&gt;LM: 检查缓存(命中)\n    LM--&gt;&gt;UI: 缓存的 Language 实例</pre><p>常用语法文件及大小：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>WASM 文件</th>\n<th>大小约</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>JavaScript</td>\n<td>tree-sitter-javascript.wasm</td>\n<td>~200KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript</td>\n<td>tree-sitter-typescript.wasm</td>\n<td>~600KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td>tree-sitter-python.wasm</td>\n<td>~150KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>tree-sitter-rust.wasm</td>\n<td>~300KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Go</td>\n<td>tree-sitter-go.wasm</td>\n<td>~180KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTML</td>\n<td>tree-sitter-html.wasm</td>\n<td>~50KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CSS</td>\n<td>tree-sitter-css.wasm</td>\n<td>~80KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JSON</td>\n<td>tree-sitter-json.wasm</td>\n<td>~20KB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 语法 WASM 文件可以通过 CDN 分发（如 unpkg、jsDelivr），也可以打包在应用中。建议使用 Service Worker 缓存策略，避免重复下载。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"vscode-dev-中的-tree-sitter\">vscode.dev 中的 Tree-sitter</h2><p>vscode.dev 是 VS Code 的浏览器版本，通过 web-tree-sitter 实现了部分语法分析功能。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class TreeSitterTokenProvider implements DocumentSemanticTokensProvider {&#10;  private parser: Parser;&#10;  private highlightQuery: Parser.Query;&#10;&#10;  async provideDocumentSemanticTokens(document: TextDocument): Promise&lt;SemanticTokens&gt; {&#10;    const tree = this.parser.parse(document.getText());&#10;    const matches = this.highlightQuery.matches(tree.rootNode);&#10;    const builder = new SemanticTokensBuilder();&#10;    for (const match of matches) {&#10;      for (const capture of match.captures) {&#10;        const tokenType = mapCaptureToTokenType(capture.name);&#10;        if (tokenType !== undefined) {&#10;          builder.push(&#10;            capture.node.startPosition.row,&#10;            capture.node.startPosition.column,&#10;            capture.node.endIndex - capture.node.startIndex,&#10;            tokenType,&#10;            0,&#10;          );&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;    return builder.build();&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"