e=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Tree</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> query</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.language.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.queryEditor.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> matches</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> query.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">matches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tree.rootNode);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> highlights</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> matches.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">flatMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      m.captures.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        startRow: c.node.startPosition.row,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        startCol: c.node.startPosition.column,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        endRow: c.node.endPosition.row,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        endCol: c.node.endPosition.column,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        className: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`capture-${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">c</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      })),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.editor.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setHighlights</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(highlights);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Playground&#10;        CODE[代码编辑面板] --&gt; PARSER[实时解析]&#10;        PARSER --&gt; TREE_VIEW[语法树面板]&#10;        QUERY[查询编辑面板] --&gt; MATCH[实时匹配]&#10;        MATCH --&gt; HIGHLIGHT[代码高亮标记]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph Playground\n        CODE[代码编辑面板] --&gt; PARSER[实时解析]\n        PARSER --&gt; TREE_VIEW[语法树面板]\n        QUERY[查询编辑面板] --&gt; MATCH[实时匹配]\n        MATCH --&gt; HIGHLIGHT[代码高亮标记]\n    end</pre><p>Playground 的核心功能：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实时解析</td>\n<td>代码编辑时即时更新语法树</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>树可视化</td>\n<td>以缩进或图形方式展示 CST 结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询测试</td>\n<td>编写和测试 S 表达式查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>捕获高亮</td>\n<td>查询匹配的节点在代码中高亮显示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节点信息</td>\n<td>点击节点查看类型、字段名、位置等详情</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多语言切换</td>\n<td>动态加载不同语言的 .wasm 语法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 官方 Playground 地址 <code>tree-sitter.github.io/tree-sitter/playground</code> 支持所有官方维护的语法。也可以通过 <code>tree-sitter playground</code> CLI 命令启动本地 Playground 测试自定义语法。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"web-worker-中的-tree-sitter\">Web Worker 中的 Tree-sitter</h2><p>在生产环境中，Tree-sitter 解析应放在 Web Worker 中执行，避免阻塞主线程。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const worker = new Worker(&#39;tree-sitter-worker.js&#39;);&#10;worker.postMessage({ type: &#39;parse&#39;, code: document.getText(), language: &#39;typescript&#39; });&#10;worker.onmessage = (event) =&gt; {&#10;  const { type, data } = event.data;&#10;  if (type === &#39;tree&#39;) updateSyntaxHighlighting(data.captures);&#10;  if (type === &#39;symbols&#39;) updateOutline(data.symbols);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> worker</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Worker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tree-sitter-worker.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">worker.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">postMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'parse'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, code: document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), language: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'typescript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">worker.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onmessage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event.data;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'tree'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">updateSyntaxHighlighting</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data.captures);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'symbols'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">updateOutline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data.symbols);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    MAIN[主线程] --&gt;|postMessage| WORKER[Web Worker]&#10;    WORKER --&gt; INIT[初始化 Parser]&#10;    WORKER --&gt; PARSE[解析代码]&#10;    WORKER --&gt; QUERY[执行查询]&#10;    WORKER --&gt;|postMessage| MAIN&#10;    MAIN --&gt; RENDER[渲染高亮/折叠]\">graph TD\n    MAIN[主线程] --&gt;|postMessage| WORKER[Web Worker]\n    WORKER --&gt; INIT[初始化 Parser]\n    WORKER --&gt; PARSE[解析代码]\n    WORKER --&gt; QUERY[执行查询]\n    WORKER --&gt;|postMessage| MAIN\n    MAIN --&gt; RENDER[渲染高亮/折叠]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>架构模式</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主线程解析</td>\n<td>实现简单</td>\n<td>大文件阻塞 UI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单 Worker</td>\n<td>不阻塞主线程</td>\n<td>多文件串行解析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Worker 池</td>\n<td>并行解析多文件</td>\n<td>内存占用较大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SharedArrayBuffer</td>\n<td>零拷贝传输数据</td>\n<td>需要 COOP/COEP 安全头</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Tree-sitter WASM))&#10;    web-tree-sitter&#10;      浏览器中运行&#10;      异步初始化&#10;      约原生 60-80% 性能&#10;    动态加载&#10;      按需加载 .wasm 语法&#10;      LanguageManager 缓存&#10;      CDN / Service Worker&#10;    vscode.dev&#10;      Extension Host Web Worker&#10;      语法高亮 / 折叠 / 符号&#10;      替代 TextMate 方案&#10;    Playground&#10;      实时解析可视化&#10;      查询测试与调试&#10;      多语言切换&#10;    Web Worker&#10;      避免阻塞主线程&#10;      Worker 池并行解析&#10;      SharedArrayBuffer 优化\">mindmap\n  root((Tree-sitter WASM))\n    web-tree-sitter\n      浏览器中运行\n      异步初始化\n      约原生 60-80% 性能\n    动态加载\n      按需加载 .wasm 语法\n      LanguageManager 缓存\n      CDN / Service Worker\n    vscode.dev\n      Extension Host Web Worker\n      语法高亮 / 折叠 / 符号\n      替代 TextMate 方案\n    Playground\n      实时解析可视化\n      查询测试与调试\n      多语言切换\n    Web Worker\n      避免阻塞主线程\n      Worker 池并行解析\n      SharedArrayBuffer 优化</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>web-tree-sitter</strong> 是 Tree-sitter 的 WASM 版本，性能约为原生的 60-80%，支持浏览器和 Node.js。</li>\n<li><strong>动态加载</strong>通过 <code>Language.load()</code> 按需加载 <code>.wasm</code> 语法文件，配合缓存策略避免重复下载。</li>\n<li><strong>vscode.dev</strong> 通过 web-tree-sitter 在浏览器中实现语法高亮、代码折叠和文档符号等功能。</li>\n<li><strong>Playground</strong> 提供交互式语法开发环境，支持实时解析、树可视化和查询测试。</li>\n<li>生产环境应将 Tree-sitter 解析放在 <strong>Web Worker</strong> 中执行，避免阻塞主线程渲染。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Tree-sitter WASM 浏览器端解析","id":"tree-sitter-wasm-浏览器端解析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"web-tree-sitter 概述","id":"web-tree-sitter-概述"},{"level":2,"text":"动态加载 .wasm 语法","id":"动态加载-wasm-语法"},{"level":2,"text":"vscode.dev 中的 Tree-sitter","id":"vscode-dev-中的-tree-sitter"},{"level":2,"text":"Playground 集成","id":"playground-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"Web Worker 中的 Tree-sitter","id":"web-worker-中的-tree-sitter"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"编辑器集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/tree-sitter-ecosystem/editor-integration"},"next":{"title":"服务器架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/building-language-servers/server-architecture"}}